  "name": "SplatThumb",
  "summary": "Windows Explorer thumbnail handler for 3D Gaussian Splatting .ply files (INRIA and PlayCanvas/SuperSplat compressed) and Spatialograph Maker .spgm projects. Renders a sample of 50k-400k splats per file, lets you set a per-file turntable view stored in your profile, reads files only, no network or telemetry.",
